# Copy to .env (or export in your shell) to enable the AI-assisted summary.
# Get a free key at https://openrouter.ai/keys
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-v1-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx

# The app tries these free models in order (src/minireport/llm.py).
# Every ID was verified with a real API call on 2026-10-07; ordered
# capability-first, so the main model is strong AND currently working:
#   1. nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free  (120B, instant, clean - main)
#   2. inclusionai/ling-3.1-flash              (fast, clean)
#   3. google/gemma-4-31b-it:free              (31B; occasional rotating 429s)
#   4. nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free  (550B; reasoning auto-rejected)
#   5. poolside/laguna-s-2.1:free              (proven in live runs)
#   6. openrouter/free                         (wildcard router, last resort)
#
# If every model fails, the report still generates with the deterministic
# summary and the failure is shown in the review UI.
